    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d803">

                <pb facs="1270" n="1256" xml:id="pg1256"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00116 European War/10–1744: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Representative on the Advisory Council for
                        Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-10-17T09:00:00+01:00">October 17, 1944—9
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>537. Italian Foreign Office has informed SAC<anchor n="46" xml:id="d803-f1"/> of
                    a communication received from National Committee of Liberation in Northern Italy
                    reporting a sharp increase in German atrocities in Northern Italy and has
                    requested urgent intervention of United Nations in this matter to cause Germans
                    to cease atrocities.</p>
                <p>At request of SAC, the ACI<anchor n="46a" xml:id="d803-f2"/> will consider at its
                    next meeting scheduled for October 20 the problem of German atrocities in
                    Northern Italy with a view to advising on means of inducing Germans to
                    cease.</p>
                <p>537 to Dept., repeated London as 34, Moscow as 29 and by hand to AmPolAd<anchor
                        n="47" xml:id="d803-f3"/> as 77.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
